        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 527,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Lipoblastoma-like tumour of the vulva is an adipocytic tumour that shares certain histomorphological features with lipoblastoma, myxoid liposarcoma, and spindle cell lipoma.</p>\r\n",
